			"notes": "# Origins+ Release 0.1.0\n\n*Knack is back baby!*\n\nOrigins+ has been updated to Minecraft 1.19.3.\nThis means that the mod now depends on Origins v1.8.1 and Pehkui v3.7.0. This is the first release for 1.19.3. I plan on doing bigger changes in the future (such as remaking the Monke), but I wanted to get a build for 1.19.3 out there first.\n\nBackend changes:\n- Removed ```originsplus:modify_snowball_damage``` power and migrated the snowman's extra damage over to: ```apoli:modify_projectile_damage```.\n\nSorry for the delay.\nMade with ❤️ - lochnessdragon"
		},
